OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 29 DEC
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Icons of
OL,5,     FBritish Light Music
OL,6,     GDonald Macleod explores how light
OL,7,     Gmusic emerged from the theatre
OL,8,     Gpits of late-19th-century Britain
OL,9,     Gand began to find audiences in
OL,10,     Gconcert halls, music halls and at
OL,11,     Ghome.
OL,12,G1700FWords and Music
OL,13,     GReadings by Jane Horrocks and Art
OL,14,     GMalik take us from Charlotte
OL,15,     GBronte to Hilaire Belloc and
OL,16,     GWilliam Blake, whilst musical
OL,17,     Gchoices evoke water mills, wind
OL,18,     Gmills and cotton mills.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
